# Your project already has .gitignore configured!

# Just verify before committing:
git status

# Should NOT see:
✗ target/
✗ *.apk  
✗ android_build/

# Should see:
✓ src/*.rs
✓ ui/*.slint
✓ *.md

# Then commit and push:
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git push
```

### 💡 Golden Rules
```
# 1. NEVER commit /target/         ← #1 Rule!
# 2. DO commit source files (.rs, .slint)
# 3. DO commit Cargo.lock (for applications)
# 4. DO commit build scripts (.sh)
# 5. DO commit documentation (.md)